oc-profiles
===========

Portions of this software (the TUI screen layout, Rose Pine styles, model
picker flow and profile name rules) are adapted from gentle-ai v3.7.0:

  https://github.com/Gentleman-Programming/gentle-ai

Files: internal/tui/styles.go, internal/tui/picker.go, internal/tui/view.go,
internal/tui/model.go (screen flow and keybindings), internal/core/roles.go
(profile name rules), internal/catalog/catalog.go (version sort).

